@local/dsh-team-workbench README · 兼容范围：已调查的接口基线是 **DSH 0.2.0-rc.2**。前端依赖该版本的 Session、slot、原生对话组件与布局接口；后续版本需重新核对。

团队执行要求当前 profile 已启用 DSH 原生实验性 Agent Team，并提供可用的 continuable 子智能体 provider。缺失能力时插件会给出诊断，不能把“插件加载成功”视为团队可运行。

此发布提供生产模块的自动化测试、模拟原生接口的集成检查、打包检查及 CI 配置。**它们不构成所有 DSH 版本、操作系统或真实模型的运行认证**。真实安装、多窗和团队行为按[验收说明](docs/ACCEPTANCE.md)另行核实。

@local/dsh-team-workbench README · 安装：本地安装时将 `target` 替换为本机源码目录的绝对路径。工具行为以[官方 plugin-manager 说明](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/blob/master/packages/boot/plugin-manager/README.md)及当前 DSH 版本为准。

**配置影响**：本 bundle 将原生 `subagent` 行设为 `maxDepth: 2`、`maxActiveSubagents: 40`。这会影响同一 profile 中使用该服务的其他任务，不只是工作台。安装前核对已有覆盖配置；详见 [配置说明](docs/CONFIGURATION.md)。没有模型配额或速率限制随安装自动增加。

安装后查看插件加载结果，在侧栏打开“超级工作台”。若当前版本要求重载或重启，应先保存并妥善结束活跃任务，再按 DSH 提示操作。

@local/dsh-team-workbench README · DSH Team Workbench：[简体中文](README.md) · [Usage](docs/USAGE.md) · [Configuration](docs/CONFIGURATION.md) · [Architecture](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)

An unofficial DeepSeek Harness plugin for **1-, 2-, or 4-pane conversations** and persistent module-oriented agent teams.

A team consists of a **leader, module members, and each member's own subagents**. The leader assigns goals and boundaries. Members plan their work and authorize delegation. A Host scheduler starts authorized work as dependencies and capacity allow.

@local/dsh-team-workbench README · Use a team：Example request for a fresh conversation:

> Build a small game content pack with an enemy-content member and an equipment-content member. Each member should deliver four complete objects, choosing its own designs, plan, and subtasks. Deliver descriptions, structured data, and verification results. Split by independent objects, with the same owner responsible through completion. Start with modest concurrency.

